message: "If you use this software, please cite it as follows."
title: "EXP-0007: Coherent Optical Vortex Propagation Study"
version: "1.0.0-r14"
date-released: 2026-09-19
author:
  - family-names: "EXP-0007 Contributors"
    orcid: ""
abstract: >
  A systematic investigation of whether coherent optical propagation generates
  novel topological structure (vortices). The study found that the apparent
  113-vortex population at z=+1280 is a detector + grid-locking artifact, not
  physical vortex creation. All data, code, and validation results are
  provided for full reproducibility.
keywords:
  - optical vortices
  - coherent optics
  - propagation
  - feature detection
  - grid-locking
  - detector artifact
  - reproducibility
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nortaq-PlayNexus/EXP-0007"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22849652"
